A chart detailing the recruitment rallies conducted by the Army Recruiting Offices (AROs)
has been submitted by the Ld. ASG which shows that the recruitment rallies during the COVID-19 Pandemic were conducted in ARO Ludhiana at Khanna from 07.12.2020 to 22.12.2020; in ARO Mahipal Mund And Ors vs Union Of India And Ors on 27 February, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/64100682/
30 Lansdowne at Kotdwar from 20.12.2020 to 02.01.2021;
